 "verdict": "DERIVED: the WP24d dressing is the exact trigonometry of the two exchange-sheet frames. Hu is real block-diagonal to machine precision on all 58 sheets; the singlet slot swaps yu^2 <-> yc^2 (fit precision 2e-10/6e-9); Lu = P01.R02(-th_B).R12(th_A) holds at 2.2e-16 per pair; alpha = sin th_B (1+cos th_A)/2 and beta = sin th_A (1+cos th_B)/2 reproduce the WP32 measurements to <1e-6, and the alpha-stable/beta-chart-dependent pattern follows from th_B being chart-group independent while th_A tracks the chart phase. The dressing is closed-form chart-atlas data - derived, not fitted, and (with WP32) not physical.",
